---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-primary">
      <p class="footer-copyright">Copyright © 2025-{year} KFACBT.</p>
      <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="页脚链接">
        <a href="https://github.com/gytxtx/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/gytxtx/Blog_Astro" target="_blank" rel="noopener">源码</a>
        <a href="mailto:gytxtx@outlook.com">E-Mail</a>
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
        <a href="https://www.travellings.cn/go.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">开往</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-secondary">
      <p>基于 <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a> 构建</p>
      <p>除另有声明外，文章采用 <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.zh-hans" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: var(--footer-gap);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
    padding-bottom: calc(var(--space-8) + var(--safe-bottom));
  }

  .footer-primary,
  .footer-secondary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-8);
  }

  .footer-inner p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-copyright {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .footer-secondary {
    font-size: var(--fs-meta);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .site-footer a {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .site-footer a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .footer-secondary a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border);
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  .footer-secondary a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: currentColor;
  }

  .footer-secondary a[rel~='license'] {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .footer-primary,
    .footer-secondary {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .footer-primary {
      gap: var(--space-4);
    }
  }

  /* 触屏扩大独立入口；正文行内链接保留自然排版。 */

  @media (any-pointer: coarse) {
    .footer-links a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: var(--control-size);
    }

    .footer-links {
      gap: var(--space-1) var(--space-5);
    }
  }
</style>
